<h3 style="color:#0B4EA2;border-bottom:2px solid #0B4EA2;padding-bottom:4px">Safety Signal Details</h3>
<p>The DMC has flagged the following in Cohort B across all sites:</p>
<table cellpadding=5 style="border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #ccc;width:100%">
<tr style="background:#f0f0f0"><th>Adverse Event</th><th>Expected Rate</th><th>Observed Rate</th><th>Grade</th></tr>
<tr><td>Immune-mediated pneumonitis</td><td>3.2%</td><td style="color:#e00"><b>7.8%</b></td><td>Grade 3-4</td></tr>
<tr><td>Elevated ALT/AST</td><td>8.5%</td><td style="color:#e00"><b>14.2%</b></td><td>Grade 3</td></tr>
<tr><td>Infusion-related reaction</td><td>12.0%</td><td>11.8%</td><td>Grade 1-2</td></tr>
</table>
<p><b>Your Site 042 has 5 patients in Cohort B. Without your Week 48 data, the DMC cannot determine if any of your patients are affected by this safety signal.</b></p>

<h3 style="color:#0B4EA2;border-bottom:2px solid #0B4EA2;padding-bottom:4px">Required Data Submission</h3>
<p>Please upload the following data for your 12 enrolled patients (all cohorts):</p>
<ol>
<li><b>Adverse Event (AE) logs</b> — all AEs since Week 44 (including severity grading per CTCAE v5.0)</li>
<li><b>Concomitant Medication (ConMed) logs</b> — all medications since Week 44</li>
<li><b>Laboratory results</b> — CBC, CMP, liver function panel (with reference ranges)</li>
<li><b>Vital signs</b> — blood pressure, heart rate, SpO2, temperature</li>
<li><b>ECOG Performance Status</b> — most recent assessment</li>
<li><b>Tumor assessment (RECIST 1.1)</b> — if scheduled for Week 48</li>
<li><b>Patient ID master list</b> — de-identified patient codes with enrollment dates</li>
</ol>

