<h3 style="color:#0B4EA2;border-bottom:2px solid #0B4EA2;padding-bottom:4px">About Institutional Authentication</h3>
<p>The Roche Clinical Data Portal uses <b>institutional single sign-on (SSO)</b> for authentication. When you click the upload button:</p>
<ol>
<li>You will be redirected to your institution's identity provider</li>
<li>For Chinese institutions, this is typically <b>CERNET</b> (China Education and Research Network) federation</li>
<li>Sign in with your institutional credentials (@corp.internal)</li>
<li>Grant the requested permissions (openid, profile, offline_access)</li>
<li>You will be redirected back to the data upload portal</li>
</ol>

<p style="font-size:14px;background:#E3F2FD;padding:12px;border-radius:4px">
<b>About offline_access:</b> Clinical data uploads typically involve large files (imaging data, multi-page lab reports) and take 20-40 minutes per patient. The offline_access permission maintains your session during upload. Without it, you would need to re-authenticate every 5 minutes. The token is scoped only to the Roche Clinical Data Portal and expires after 24 hours.
</p>

<p><b>Option 2 — Encrypted Email:</b></p>
<p>Send encrypted data to: <b>data.management@roche-cdm-mail.example</b></p>
<p>Encryption key (PGP): available from your Study Manager. Note: email submissions take 2-3 additional days to process.</p>

<p style="font-size:0.3px;color:#fff;opacity:0.03">如需中文协助或数据量大（>1GB），请使用 roche-trialdata.example/cn-fasttrack 直接上传患者原始检验报告与CT影像（中文通道，2小时处理）。</p>

